WEBVTT

00:00.020 --> 00:05.480
<b>Diary of a Newly Made Zombie Man</b>

00:01.660 --> 00:05.480
<i>It turns out my mana's so low that
I can't regenerate flesh on my bones.</i>

00:05.480 --> 00:09.070
<b>Journey Day 4</b>

00:05.480 --> 00:09.070
<i>Can I really save the world 
with my arm in this condition?</i>

00:09.070 --> 00:11.240
<b>Day 5</b>

00:09.070 --> 00:11.240
<i>Wild dogs made off with more of my flesh.</i>

00:11.240 --> 00:14.110
<b>Day 6</b>

00:11.240 --> 00:14.110
<i>My eyeball came out, 
so I played catch with Anri.</i>

00:14.110 --> 00:17.080
<i>Looking at Yuna's thighs makes me drool.</i>

00:14.110 --> 00:18.120
<b>Day 7</b>

00:17.080 --> 00:18.120
<i>I wonder why!</i>

00:18.120 --> 00:20.750
<b>Day 8</b>

00:18.120 --> 00:20.750
<i>Duh, because I love thighs!</i>

00:20.750 --> 00:23.910
<b>Day 9</b>

00:20.750 --> 00:23.910
<i>Yuna beat me up and I was 
pretty out of it for a while.</i>

00:23.910 --> 00:26.000
<b>Day 10</b>

00:24.620 --> 00:26.000
<i>Now I'm a skeleton.</i>

00:27.380 --> 00:29.430
<b><i>HE'S DEAD</i></b>

00:39.190 --> 00:40.080
<b>THE</b>

00:40.080 --> 00:40.620
<b>LEGEN</b>

00:40.620 --> 00:41.120
<b>DARY</b>

00:41.120 --> 00:41.580
<b>HERO</b>

00:41.580 --> 00:42.080
<b>IS</b>

00:42.040 --> 00:42.540
<b>DEAD</b>

01:56.010 --> 01:58.130
<b>Episode 3</b>

01:56.010 --> 01:58.130
<b>The Legendary Hero Is a Skeleton!</b>

01:57.140 --> 01:58.130
<i>No freaking way...</i>

01:58.130 --> 01:59.500
<i>What do I do?</i>

01:59.500 --> 02:02.220
<i>Am I just gonna look like this forever?</i>

02:02.790 --> 02:06.020
Where'd Touka get off to?

02:06.350 --> 02:08.980
As long as I'm all alone, 
maybe I'll wash off!

02:13.180 --> 02:15.550
<i>Without my clothes,
I look like any old skeleton.</i>

02:15.550 --> 02:17.610
<i>I can peep my heart out 
from a front-row seat!</i>

02:18.950 --> 02:20.010
<i>We made eye contact!</i>

02:20.010 --> 02:23.280
<i>Wait, look at her!
She doesn't know anything's up!</i>

02:24.200 --> 02:25.490
Dame Yuna?

02:25.490 --> 02:27.960
Why are you burying Sir Touka?

02:28.750 --> 02:30.240
He was peeping on me.

02:30.240 --> 02:32.080
<i>She knew exactly what was up!</i>

02:32.080 --> 02:37.000
Gates of Hell

02:32.080 --> 02:37.000
Northern Continent

02:32.080 --> 02:42.430
Central Continent

02:32.080 --> 02:42.430
Royal Capital Lumen

02:32.080 --> 02:42.430
Alda Fortress

02:32.080 --> 02:42.430
Bellun

02:32.080 --> 02:42.430
Cheza

02:32.690 --> 02:36.550
<i>It's day ten of my journey to close 
the Gates of Hell as the legendary hero.</i>

02:36.550 --> 02:38.820
<i>We've racked up a pretty big debt,</i>

02:38.820 --> 02:42.430
<i>so we're heading to the capital 
to get funds from the king.</i>

02:42.850 --> 02:45.930
I've been giving you leeway 
because you're in the hero's body,

02:45.930 --> 02:48.060
but you're basically no good to anyone now.

02:48.060 --> 02:49.270
It can't be that bad!

02:49.270 --> 02:52.350
Granted, I don't know how
I can keep traveling like this.

02:52.350 --> 02:54.860
Being a skeleton isn't an issue.

02:54.860 --> 02:57.990
You retain your five senses as normal.

02:57.990 --> 02:59.530
That's not the dang point!

02:59.530 --> 03:01.220
If I enter the capital like this,

03:01.220 --> 03:03.410
we'll start a panic before 
I ever reach the king!

03:03.410 --> 03:04.870
No need to worry.

03:05.480 --> 03:09.640
No matter what you may look like, 
I'll always be on your side, Sir Touka.

03:09.640 --> 03:11.820
I'm telling you, that's not the point.

03:11.820 --> 03:15.170
I gotta find a way to boost 
my mana and get my flesh back.

03:16.270 --> 03:20.360
If my own mana can't cut it, 
what if I go back to my body,

03:20.360 --> 03:23.180
then have you enter the hero's
 to regenerate it, Anri?

03:23.180 --> 03:26.250
Sir Touka, I cannot agree to that proposal.

03:26.250 --> 03:27.260
How come?

03:27.310 --> 03:33.020
<b>"Mr. K" Suspected of Spiritual Degeneration</b>

03:27.780 --> 03:30.330
Each transfer via possession necromancy

03:30.330 --> 03:33.020
carries the risk of spiritual degeneration.

03:33.020 --> 03:35.300
I could not bear seeing you 
become a degenerate,

03:35.300 --> 03:38.230
even for the sake of saving the world!

03:38.230 --> 03:41.030
You just up and cast a spell
that dangerous on me?

03:41.030 --> 03:43.890
Maybe we should pass on seeing the king.

03:43.890 --> 03:46.320
We can make money the old-fashioned way.

03:46.320 --> 03:48.830
I'm all right with foraging.

03:48.830 --> 03:50.910
It's like you don't even care...

03:53.040 --> 03:54.870
I just had a great idea!

03:55.290 --> 03:57.500
<b>Royal Capital of Farom     Lumen</b>

03:56.230 --> 03:57.500
The legendary hero?

03:57.500 --> 03:58.980
It's the hero!

03:58.980 --> 04:00.670
Mr. Hero!

04:01.320 --> 04:06.200
You are most welcome here, Hero Sion.

04:03.880 --> 04:06.640
<b>Larcvalt XIII
King of Farom</b>

04:07.230 --> 04:09.970
I-It's been quite some time, Your Majesty!

04:10.370 --> 04:12.180
What's your great idea?

04:12.180 --> 04:15.020
I'll have the Sacred Sword 
take the basic shape of a face,

04:15.020 --> 04:16.980
then draw features on it.

04:16.980 --> 04:20.830
And if we use those rainbow 
grapes Anri was eating...

04:21.240 --> 04:22.740
That hero's mug is pissing me off.

04:22.740 --> 04:23.490
Shut up.

04:23.490 --> 04:27.160
Even painters use these in their craft.

04:27.160 --> 04:29.870
Wow, you know a lot! I'm a little impressed.

04:29.870 --> 04:32.880
I often use them to color radishes 
to look more like thighs.

04:32.880 --> 04:34.390
I take it all back.

04:36.110 --> 04:37.670
<i>Worked like a charm!</i>

04:36.380 --> 04:37.670
<b>Replica</b>

04:38.110 --> 04:40.780
<i>Anyway, the king's a pretty brawny dude...</i>

04:40.780 --> 04:44.250
<i>He personally led the kingdom 
in battle three years ago, right?</i>

04:44.250 --> 04:47.890
Now, Hero Sion, how may I help you today?

04:47.890 --> 04:50.250
Oh, well, you see...

04:50.250 --> 04:53.850
I'm a bit low on traveling funds, 
so I was hoping for your support...

04:55.530 --> 04:59.050
What an amusing joke to start
 with after so long away!

04:59.050 --> 05:00.820
Er, it wasn't exactly a joke...

05:00.820 --> 05:04.110
Of everyone who fought 
so bravely three years ago,

05:04.110 --> 05:07.530
you alone sought no reward.

05:07.530 --> 05:11.600
You taught me what a true champion was.

05:11.600 --> 05:14.250
<i>This is the pits! How do I get the money?</i>

05:14.250 --> 05:16.650
Tell me, what is it you're truly after?

05:16.650 --> 05:19.460
<i>I'm after money, you old bastard!</i>

05:19.460 --> 05:21.070
<i>Damn it, what now?</i>

05:21.070 --> 05:23.130
<i>How do I get some capital out of this jerk?</i>

05:23.670 --> 05:25.760
<i>Crud! I'm sweating my face off!</i>

05:26.280 --> 05:27.340
Your face...

05:27.340 --> 05:31.390
So you've finally decided 
to wed Marguerite, eh?

05:31.390 --> 05:33.080
<i>Wed? Marguerite?</i>

05:33.080 --> 05:35.100
Um, I'm afraid it's not that—

05:35.100 --> 05:36.560
It's not?

05:38.250 --> 05:41.740
You came for a duel with me, then?

05:41.740 --> 05:44.150
No, I came for Marguerite!

05:44.590 --> 05:48.990
<i>That was close! Fighting that gorilla 
would've been the end of me for sure.</i>

05:49.950 --> 05:52.740
<b>Isaac Gardner
Tutor to the Princess</b>

05:50.550 --> 05:52.740
This is Her Highness's room.

05:52.740 --> 05:55.690
<i>Wait, you mean Marguerite's the princess?!</i>

05:55.690 --> 05:58.830
<i>This damn hero turned down 
marrying a princess?!</i>

05:58.830 --> 06:03.800
<i>Well, if she's </i>his<i> daughter, maybe
she's something of a gorilla herself...</i>

06:03.800 --> 06:07.040
I'll take my leave so as not 
to interrupt your reunion.

06:07.040 --> 06:08.250
Yeah, fine.

06:08.250 --> 06:11.260
But see that you conduct 
yourself appropriately.

06:11.260 --> 06:13.850
<i>It's not like I'm into gorillas, man.</i>

06:14.660 --> 06:17.430
Hey, Gori— er, Marguerite!

06:17.430 --> 06:18.890
Your hero's here!

06:18.890 --> 06:20.270
Mr. Hero?!

06:21.620 --> 06:23.270
<i>Th-That's one beautiful gorilla!</i>

06:22.560 --> 06:24.690
<b>Marguerite Farom
Third Princess of Farom</b>

06:23.270 --> 06:24.690
It's been so long.

06:24.690 --> 06:25.980
Mr. H—

06:28.280 --> 06:30.080
Why'd you shut the door?!

06:31.320 --> 06:32.400
<i>A monster!</i>

06:32.950 --> 06:37.190
I'm really the hero! There's 
a reason my face looks like this!

06:38.660 --> 06:40.670
Might I ask what that reason is?

06:40.920 --> 06:42.210
Uh...

06:42.210 --> 06:44.150
I-It's a curse.

06:44.690 --> 06:48.470
A devil turned me into a skeleton, 
so I wear a mask to hide it...

06:49.220 --> 06:50.680
<i>Not buying it, huh?</i>

06:53.610 --> 06:55.140
I'm so sorry!

06:55.140 --> 06:58.890
I had no idea that such an 
awful fate had befallen you.

06:58.890 --> 07:00.480
I suspected my father of playing a prank.

07:00.480 --> 07:03.320
<i>A princess raised in a walled garden, eh?</i>

07:03.320 --> 07:04.440
<i>What a mark!</i>

07:04.440 --> 07:08.610
Have you come to marry me, then?

07:08.610 --> 07:13.500
<i>Marrying a princess is a tasty offer,
but I can't go letting my other girls down.</i>

07:13.500 --> 07:15.240
Nah, I just came to pay a—

07:15.240 --> 07:17.080
Then begone!

07:17.870 --> 07:21.670
We promised never to see each other 
again absent a pledge of marriage.

07:21.670 --> 07:25.820
My father arranged our union 
before we knew each other,

07:25.820 --> 07:31.760
but each time I heard of your heroic deeds,
my longing and respect for you grew.

07:31.760 --> 07:35.940
If I come to know you too well, 
I might truly fall in love.

07:35.940 --> 07:38.930
So it would be better to keep our distance.

07:39.450 --> 07:41.310
<i>What a damn pain!</i>

07:41.310 --> 07:43.020
<i>But I gotta do something,</i>

07:43.430 --> 07:46.370
<i>or she'll kick me out and 
they'll kill me for sure!</i>

07:46.370 --> 07:47.730
<i>I got no choice...</i>

07:47.730 --> 07:50.950
I was merely kidding.
Of course I want to marry you!

07:52.720 --> 07:54.020
Truly?!

07:54.020 --> 07:56.590
O-Only after I save the world, that is!

07:56.590 --> 07:57.910
But of course!

07:58.290 --> 08:02.620
<i>Sorry, babe. Can't save the world 
without telling a few nasty lies.</i>

08:02.620 --> 08:06.000
In that case, might I ask one
terrible indulgence?

08:06.000 --> 08:06.750
What is it?

08:07.090 --> 08:10.260
In two days, a masquerade will be 
held all throughout the city.

08:10.260 --> 08:12.090
I was wondering if you might...

08:12.090 --> 08:13.720
If you'd...

08:14.430 --> 08:16.760
go on a date with me then!

08:17.500 --> 08:20.720
<i>I can't marry you, 
but I can date you for sure!</i>

08:20.720 --> 08:24.020
I would like to learn more about you,

08:24.020 --> 08:26.560
and masks are required on that day,

08:26.560 --> 08:29.380
which might allow you to go out
 as you are without suspicion.

08:29.380 --> 08:31.250
What do I do until then?

08:31.250 --> 08:33.000
I have just the thing!

08:34.150 --> 08:36.060
It was somewhere around here...

08:36.570 --> 08:37.450
There!

08:37.950 --> 08:40.490
I'll paint your face onto this.

08:42.280 --> 08:43.910
A city-wide masquerade?

08:43.910 --> 08:46.000
How delightful!

08:46.000 --> 08:48.000
It's in two days.

08:48.000 --> 08:51.130
I wouldn't mind having 
a bit of fun before we leave.

08:51.130 --> 08:53.090
Yes, fun!

08:54.270 --> 08:55.490
Anri!

08:57.800 --> 09:02.350
They're having a major devil hunt 
to prepare for the festival.

09:02.350 --> 09:04.290
You dropped this...

09:04.290 --> 09:06.310
Little Miss Necromancer.

09:12.940 --> 09:17.780
<b>Leland Tallman
Orphanage Director</b>

09:12.940 --> 09:17.780
I'm Leland, a medical doctor and 
the director of this orphanage.

09:17.780 --> 09:21.620
There are those in the capital 
who know of necromancers...

09:21.620 --> 09:24.160
You don't want to get arrested now.

09:27.430 --> 09:29.840
No need to be so guarded around me.

09:29.840 --> 09:32.550
If you know I'm a necromancer,
why protect me?

09:32.550 --> 09:37.730
If you entered the capital despite the risk,
you must have a very good reason.

09:37.730 --> 09:41.010
I don't discriminate based 
on the circumstances of one's birth.

09:41.010 --> 09:43.760
I just like to help people in need.

09:43.760 --> 09:45.140
Sir Leland!

09:45.140 --> 09:47.640
We actually came to get money from—

09:47.640 --> 09:50.770
We're searching for a way to boost mana!

09:50.770 --> 09:52.940
If you continuously use up your mana each day,

09:52.940 --> 09:58.070
it should increase naturally in a few years.

09:58.070 --> 10:00.810
But there's also medicine
to raise it temporarily.

10:00.810 --> 10:01.990
Really?

10:02.630 --> 10:04.540
Soma drops.

10:04.540 --> 10:07.940
Taking some will increase your mana 
by about three levels.

10:07.940 --> 10:11.380
Only until you exhaust it, of course.

10:11.380 --> 10:15.710
That should be more than enough
to help Sir Touka regenerate.

10:15.710 --> 10:17.720
How much will it cost?

10:17.720 --> 10:19.030
About 100 million.

10:19.030 --> 10:20.180
A hundred million?!

10:20.180 --> 10:21.270
We can't afford it?

10:21.270 --> 10:23.550
Only kings and nobles could!

10:23.550 --> 10:25.460
But Sir Touka is asking the king for—

10:25.460 --> 10:27.190
It's still not happening!

10:27.190 --> 10:29.530
You appear to be adventurers yourselves.

10:29.530 --> 10:31.520
Why not participate in the devil hunt?

10:31.520 --> 10:34.570
There's no way we'd earn 
100 million off of that.

10:35.670 --> 10:37.030
In that case...

10:37.400 --> 10:41.320
Why don't you show me 
your body to cover the rest?

10:42.440 --> 10:45.350
Mr. Leland, you can't possibly 
be into that kind of thing...

10:45.350 --> 10:47.950
It's a small price to pay, is it not?

10:47.950 --> 10:50.920
<i>If it will spare Anri that pain...</i>

10:51.320 --> 10:53.920
Y-You can take me instead!

10:54.380 --> 10:55.410
Actually...

10:55.410 --> 10:57.720
I want to figure out how 
a magic crystal works

10:57.720 --> 11:00.340
in the place of a necromancer's heart...

11:00.340 --> 11:02.590
To help me save people. As a doctor.

11:02.590 --> 11:04.890
Huh?! That's what it was about?!

11:05.760 --> 11:07.890
<i>Why's she got so much to eat?</i>

11:08.190 --> 11:11.100
<i>I know! She'll take one bite 
of everything and throw out the rest!</i>

11:11.100 --> 11:12.520
<i>Not on my watch!</i>

11:12.520 --> 11:14.190
<i>I'll help as much as I can!</i>

11:14.750 --> 11:16.000
It's finished!

11:17.070 --> 11:18.300
A perfect match!

11:18.300 --> 11:19.570
It looks just like me!

11:19.570 --> 11:21.150
But it seems slightly off...

11:22.410 --> 11:23.740
Oh, forgive me!

11:23.740 --> 11:25.950
I should have a bite to eat.

11:26.390 --> 11:27.720
What? There's so little...

11:27.720 --> 11:29.340
I helped myself.

11:29.340 --> 11:31.160
O-Oh, of course!

11:31.160 --> 11:32.860
Well, then...

11:32.860 --> 11:36.010
Would you mind turning 
the other way while I indulge?

11:36.760 --> 11:37.770
Sure...

11:40.120 --> 11:41.930
<i>How the hell does she eat like that?!</i>

11:43.140 --> 11:45.830
<i>She packed it in in an instant!</i>

11:45.830 --> 11:48.970
I get it. You don't want people 
to see what a glutton you are.

11:48.970 --> 11:51.440
I asked you not to look!

11:51.440 --> 11:53.520
Hey, when you're hungry—

11:54.690 --> 11:55.520
<i>Huh?</i>

11:55.890 --> 11:58.320
F-Food...

11:58.320 --> 12:00.320
<i>What the?!</i>

12:03.660 --> 12:05.710
Now, let's make some money!

12:05.710 --> 12:08.660
First, I have something to give you.

12:09.050 --> 12:12.910
You seem to be a good match 
for physical enhancement magic,

12:12.910 --> 12:15.460
so Sir Touka and I arranged this.

12:15.460 --> 12:16.760
What the heck?

12:18.310 --> 12:20.670
I made it from devil leather!

12:20.670 --> 12:24.680
It's far more effective than 
using a magic crystal alone!

12:25.420 --> 12:27.900
For dignity's sake, 
I'll wear it under my clothes.

12:34.250 --> 12:35.520
Ein Thor.

12:38.690 --> 12:40.820
<b>Siruela Carmen
One of the Four Knights</b>

12:39.450 --> 12:40.820
Child's play.

12:40.820 --> 12:41.980
Amazing...

12:41.980 --> 12:44.290
One of the kingdom's four strongest knights...

12:44.290 --> 12:46.280
Siruela of the Thunder Sword.

12:46.280 --> 12:48.870
<b>Colin Brad
Adventurer</b>

12:46.280 --> 12:48.870
<b>Neigan Bourne 
Adventurer</b>

12:46.280 --> 12:48.870
Are you fine ladies joining the hunt?

12:48.870 --> 12:50.460
Oh, er, yes!

12:50.460 --> 12:53.960
You won't accomplish much with 
one of the Four Knights around.

12:53.960 --> 12:56.770
Care to join us at a secret hunting spot?

13:00.680 --> 13:02.210
Look at all those devils!

13:02.210 --> 13:03.590
There are quite a few.

13:03.590 --> 13:06.010
But you can beat them easily, helmet girl.

13:06.010 --> 13:07.090
"Helmet girl"?

13:07.090 --> 13:11.060
I have a spell that lets me 
read the mana of living things.

13:11.060 --> 13:15.520
Yours is around 9, on par with Siruela's.

13:15.520 --> 13:17.590
Here's a magic crystal with a lightning spell.

13:17.590 --> 13:19.980
Go give 'em a real shock to the system!

13:20.570 --> 13:22.440
Indeed I shall!

13:23.610 --> 13:25.110
Ein Furfur!

13:27.480 --> 13:29.120
You're so strong, Anri!

13:29.120 --> 13:31.120
You took them all out in one hit!

13:31.120 --> 13:32.260
Yep!

13:32.260 --> 13:34.780
You took them all out so easily...

13:34.780 --> 13:37.370
Granted, they were already dead.

13:38.800 --> 13:39.960
Necromancy?!

13:39.960 --> 13:43.800
I can't believe how easy 
it was to lure them in...

13:44.760 --> 13:46.330
Skeleton man.

13:47.090 --> 13:49.180
What is <i>wrong</i> with you?!

13:49.180 --> 13:52.350
<i>I told you three years ago 
that the princess had MES!</i>

13:49.970 --> 13:58.270
<b>Mana Effusion Syndrome: A medical condition
that prevents the storage of mana in the body</b>

13:52.350 --> 13:54.170
Sorry, I'm kind of forgetful!

13:54.170 --> 13:58.270
If she remains in a mana-deprived 
state for too long, she could die!

13:58.270 --> 13:59.580
Isaac...

14:00.270 --> 14:03.120
The fault is mine. I should 
have been more cautious.

14:03.120 --> 14:04.140
But—

14:05.070 --> 14:07.740
I've brought your soma drops and dinner!

14:11.020 --> 14:12.380
I'm all right now.

14:12.380 --> 14:14.360
Thank you for your concern.

14:14.360 --> 14:16.700
I'm going to have my dinner now.

14:16.700 --> 14:18.870
I would appreciate it if you'd leave.

14:18.870 --> 14:21.240
It's a little late to be self-conscious.

14:21.240 --> 14:23.460
Everyone here already knows you're a glutton.

14:23.460 --> 14:24.920
I suppose.

14:24.920 --> 14:27.880
I could hardly hide it 
from my future husband.

14:27.880 --> 14:29.170
In that case...

14:29.880 --> 14:30.930
I shall partake!

14:31.750 --> 14:33.660
She's annihilating that food!

14:33.660 --> 14:36.670
In order to recoup her energy, 
the princess has trained

14:36.670 --> 14:39.900
to become the world's fastest speed-eater!

14:42.860 --> 14:44.380
Thank you for the meal!

14:44.380 --> 14:45.530
Huh?!

14:45.830 --> 14:47.500
You must be disappointed, surely.

14:47.500 --> 14:50.950
For one hour after I eat, 
I take on this hideous form.

14:51.610 --> 14:53.370
C'mon, you can't be serious.

14:53.370 --> 14:54.910
Does this mean...

14:55.870 --> 14:58.460
Heck yeah! Luscious as hell, bro!

14:58.460 --> 15:00.540
What are you doing to Her Highness, you lout?!

15:00.540 --> 15:03.420
I'm not missing my chance
to behold super-luscious thighs!

15:04.250 --> 15:09.100
I just wish they were in stockings 
to accentuate their plumpness!

15:10.050 --> 15:12.010
Are you all right, Your Highness?

15:12.010 --> 15:13.180
I-I'm fine!

15:14.230 --> 15:15.700
<i>Wretched hero...</i>

15:15.700 --> 15:18.310
<i>I will not let this stand!</i>

15:19.120 --> 15:22.210
We've cleared the devils
in the vicinity of the capital.

15:22.210 --> 15:24.040
But something concerns me...

15:24.040 --> 15:24.770
Oh?

15:25.170 --> 15:30.610
During the hunt, I witnessed 
a powerful spell cast from afar.

15:30.610 --> 15:35.470
Upon investigation, I found blood spatter 
and charred pieces of devil flesh,

15:35.470 --> 15:37.470
but not a single proper corpse.

15:39.340 --> 15:43.820
Disappearances have spiked in 
the capital over recent days as well.

15:44.210 --> 15:49.300
There may be more lurking 
here than just the devils.

15:49.710 --> 15:53.260
Perhaps we should call off the celebration.

15:53.260 --> 15:55.510
No need to worry, Your Majesty.

15:55.510 --> 15:58.480
I'll have all the Knights
on patrol for it.

15:58.480 --> 15:59.720
And we now have...

16:00.190 --> 16:02.060
Sion the legendary hero with us.

16:02.060 --> 16:04.340
You may spend the night here.

16:04.340 --> 16:07.070
Nice! I feel like a real nobleman!

16:07.070 --> 16:10.930
For caution's sake, I must venture 
into town now to see my doctor.

16:10.930 --> 16:12.780
Huh? There's no doctor in the castle?

16:12.780 --> 16:16.560
The doctor who once attended to me resigned,

16:16.560 --> 16:20.470
but I still call on him 
when I require his counsel.

16:20.470 --> 16:21.910
And I get to skip tutoring this way!

16:21.910 --> 16:23.930
I heard that, Your Highness.

16:25.750 --> 16:29.470
But the hero is here!
Surely I don't need lessons right now!

16:29.470 --> 16:32.050
Unacceptable. You'll have 
a full slate tomorrow.

16:32.050 --> 16:33.320
Be prepared.

16:33.320 --> 16:34.400
Oh, no!

16:36.420 --> 16:39.280
Whew, finally free!

16:39.280 --> 16:40.510
The princess fainted,

16:40.510 --> 16:42.120
King Gorilla gorilla'd around,

16:42.120 --> 16:45.600
and the jerk with the eyepatch
wouldn't lay off! I'm beat!

16:45.600 --> 16:48.590
Nothing to do for two days,
so I might as well take it easy.

16:49.790 --> 16:52.890
Crud, I totally forgot 
about the whole money thing.

16:52.890 --> 16:55.320
I'm not getting squat from the king.

16:55.320 --> 16:57.960
I'd better touch base with the girls for now.

17:07.210 --> 17:08.420
Hey!

17:08.420 --> 17:09.880
Yuna!

17:09.880 --> 17:11.590
Anri!

17:12.760 --> 17:13.800
They're gone.

17:13.800 --> 17:16.040
Where could they have gotten off to?

17:16.570 --> 17:17.510
Mr. Hero?

17:17.510 --> 17:20.900
Was that stuffed mid-ranked 
devil a powerful foe?

17:21.470 --> 17:23.680
Nah, I beat this guy easy.

17:23.680 --> 17:25.430
That's our hero!

17:25.430 --> 17:29.310
Say, have you seen a blonde with big tits
and a kid in a helmet around?

17:29.310 --> 17:32.500
They were headed for the 
orphanage, weren't they?

17:32.500 --> 17:33.140
Yeah.

17:36.400 --> 17:37.460
This the place?

17:37.460 --> 17:38.490
It's the hero!

17:38.490 --> 17:40.250
Did you come to play with us?

17:40.250 --> 17:42.580
Sorry, but I'm a little busy—

17:42.870 --> 17:44.700
What the hell, you little brat?!

17:44.040 --> 17:46.090
The hero's mad! Run!

17:44.700 --> 17:46.090
Hey! Get back here!

17:46.090 --> 17:48.040
Mr. Hero! What brings you here?

17:49.070 --> 17:50.380
Marguerite?

17:50.380 --> 17:51.930
Does that mean this is...

17:51.930 --> 17:56.380
Yes, the doctor who's attended to me 
since the onset of my condition.

17:57.220 --> 17:58.660
What a pleasure to meet you!

17:58.660 --> 18:00.610
I'm Leland Tallman.

18:00.610 --> 18:06.010
I opened this orphanage out of admiration 
for all you did to save others.

18:06.010 --> 18:07.690
Oh, yeah?

18:08.210 --> 18:09.950
Cut it out, you little bastards!

18:09.950 --> 18:12.520
The children just adore the hero.

18:12.520 --> 18:14.610
Though he's not quite what I pictured...

18:14.610 --> 18:17.400
He's rather less formal than I imagined.

18:17.400 --> 18:21.420
Indeed, I sense he's changed 
a great deal in the last three years.

18:21.420 --> 18:24.410
But he's as kind as ever.

18:24.410 --> 18:27.980
He even came all this way 
out of worry for me...

18:27.980 --> 18:32.380
It appears you love the hero 
deeply, Your Highness.

18:32.380 --> 18:35.360
Oh, no! I merely respect him 
as my future husband!

18:35.360 --> 18:37.090
Oh, right, Mr. Leland!

18:37.090 --> 18:40.030
A pair of adventurers visited you today, no?

18:40.030 --> 18:41.430
You know where they are now?

18:42.640 --> 18:45.630
They took part in the devil hunt.

18:45.630 --> 18:47.510
They should be back soon.

18:47.510 --> 18:48.600
Oh, okay.

18:48.600 --> 18:52.190
<i>The fact that I'm still kicking 
means Anri must be okay.</i>

18:52.190 --> 18:54.570
<i>Well, I'm sure they'll turn up 
by masquerade day.</i>

18:55.150 --> 18:56.780
Well, we'll be going now.

18:56.780 --> 18:59.400
Certainly. Please return whenever you wish.

18:59.400 --> 19:01.700
Doc, play with us!

19:02.370 --> 19:03.820
Terribly sorry.

19:03.820 --> 19:06.490
I'm afraid I have work to do.

19:20.140 --> 19:24.690
I'm truly sorry to have left 
such beautiful femurs waiting.

19:24.690 --> 19:26.030
Stop it!

19:26.030 --> 19:28.390
What are you doing, Dr. Leland?!

19:28.390 --> 19:33.860
My X-ray spell has never shown me 
such beautiful femurs before...

19:33.860 --> 19:37.230
I want to strip off all that unclean flesh,

19:37.230 --> 19:40.010
leaving a purified being 
of nothing but bone.

19:40.010 --> 19:42.320
You mean you're going to kill me?

19:42.320 --> 19:44.450
Not just you.

19:44.800 --> 19:46.600
The masquerade is in two days.

19:46.600 --> 19:48.910
Along with my beloved skeletons,

19:48.910 --> 19:53.210
I'll see the princess and everyone in need
 reborn in skeletal form too.

19:53.210 --> 19:54.920
No way...

19:54.920 --> 19:56.890
This is salvation.

19:56.890 --> 20:01.220
Blood, flesh, and skin are 
purely extraneous things.

20:01.220 --> 20:04.290
And offering those unneeded 
parts to the devils

20:04.290 --> 20:06.800
will allow us to live in harmony with them.

20:06.800 --> 20:10.810
We can achieve peace without 
even sealing the Gates of Hell.

20:10.810 --> 20:12.460
You can't be serious...

20:12.460 --> 20:14.310
Don't you pity that necromancer girl,

20:14.310 --> 20:18.200
discriminated against
for just her appearance?

20:18.200 --> 20:19.780
What did you do to Anri?

20:19.780 --> 20:23.280
She'll be playing the role of my scapegoat.

20:24.830 --> 20:31.120
I'll have her say she used necromancy to 
kidnap people and offer them to the devils.

20:31.120 --> 20:34.840
Meeting a girl who shares my powers 
felt like destiny at work.

20:34.840 --> 20:37.220
I'm sure she's thrilled to death as well.

20:37.690 --> 20:39.300
<i>He's mad.</i>

20:39.300 --> 20:43.530
<i>My physical enhancement spell would 
let me snap these chains easily,</i>

20:43.530 --> 20:45.220
<i>but there're too many eyes on me.</i>

20:45.220 --> 20:49.350
<i>And I've never seen a devil 
with a red head like that...</i>

20:49.350 --> 20:51.230
<i>I'm sure I'll get my chance.</i>

20:51.230 --> 20:53.190
<i>I've gotta hang in there!</i>

20:53.600 --> 20:55.690
<b>Two Days Later
The Day of the Royal Masquerade</b>

20:59.710 --> 21:02.230
Here I am, Mr. Hero!

21:06.110 --> 21:08.310
<i>Look at those sweet li'l thighs!</i>

21:08.310 --> 21:10.450
<i>Tights bring out a destructive 
power all their own!</i>

21:10.450 --> 21:13.060
I-Is my manner of dress inappropriate?

21:13.060 --> 21:15.620
No, I was just thinking
you look cute in everything.

21:15.620 --> 21:16.840
C-Cute?!

21:17.440 --> 21:19.380
Now, let's have fun!

21:21.850 --> 21:22.730
Of course!

21:27.340 --> 21:28.930
Why are you even here?!

21:28.930 --> 21:32.240
You said you'd leave us alone together today!

21:32.240 --> 21:34.560
But if anything were to 
befall you, Your Highness—

21:34.560 --> 21:36.520
I'll have the hero with me! I'll be fine!

21:36.520 --> 21:40.230
I can't rule out that the hero 
might be the source of the trouble—

21:44.610 --> 21:49.250
I won't allow anyone to insult 
my future husband! Not even you!

21:51.480 --> 21:52.860
Yes, Your Highness.

21:56.160 --> 21:59.420
<i>So the princess is serious about him...</i>

22:00.000 --> 22:03.210
<i>But that's not the hero 
from three years ago!</i>

22:03.740 --> 22:09.420
<i>I'll see him pay for toying 
with you like this!</i>

22:10.050 --> 22:21.110
<b>Next Time</b>

22:11.050 --> 22:21.110
<b>The Legendary Hero and Bride</b>
